{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google早在2025年8月就宣佈了針對Android生態的嚴格政策調整，要求用户手機上安裝的所有應用，包括從第三方商店側載的應用，都必須來自經過驗證的開發者。Google當時給出的理由是，匿名開發者發佈的應用更容易向不知情的用户傳播惡意軟件。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587218.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:01.935537+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:13:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820554+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820554+00:00","content_hash":"825153912b763822b42de4dde3c25bbe823af824d7f36415f219d2568bf25941","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}